{
  "id": 8867180150983,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 22",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-22",
  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom with this personalized baseball comforter set from Jeminise, designed for ultimate comfort and style. Perfect for baseball players, fans, and lovers, this set offers a soft and durable bedding solution that celebrates your passion for the game or makes a thoughtful custom gift.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your name for a unique touch, making it an ideal gift for men and women, moms and dads, or for special occasions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to perfectly fit your bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Material:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling for a soft, comfortable, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection techniques to prevent fading and smooth, fine, and compact stitching along the edges for lasting quality.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried without heat, ensuring quick drying and fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sports Theme:</strong> Showcases a vibrant baseball thunder pattern, perfect for sports enthusiasts and adding a dynamic touch to any room.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An excellent gift for Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, or Christmas for anyone who loves baseball.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
